{
    "title": "Fruitz - Dating app",
    "description": "FIND DATES TO YOUR TASTE:\r\nFruitz is a dating app dedicated to helping you meet new people, who are looking for the same kind of relationship as you. With Fruitz you can cut straight to the chase with the security of knowing that you'll only match and meet with people who are on the same page. Whether you're looking for something serious, a date or two, or even just one night between the sheets - Fruitz has the fruits to help you directly express what you're looking for.\r\n\r\nCHOOSE YOUR FRUIT: \r\nHow many times have you swiped right on dating apps, only to realise that the person on the other end of the chat is on a completely different page to you? Yep, thought as much! That's why with Fruitz you state what you're looking for from the start, by choosing a fruit that represents the type of relationship you want: \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf52 Cherry-pick the one for you \r\n\ud83c\udf47 Have Grape dates, no headaches\r\n\ud83c\udf49 Find fruits with benefits \r\n\ud83c\udf51 Or for one night between the sheets\r\n\r\nSAY GOODBYE TO BORING CHATS:\r\nDating doesn\u2019t have to be boring. On Fruitz you can start the chat on an interesting note, by choosing from hundreds of juicy opening questions. Some questions are wholesome and some will get you to reveal all your secrets...but that's usually how a great relationship starts, right? So, once you make a smoothie (a.k.a a match), you\u2019ll definitely get to know them well before you meet them IRL.\r\n\r\nTASTE THE BEST WITH FRUITZ PREMIUM:\r\nWith Premium you can access exciting features including: \r\n\r\nUnlimited likes - Swipe right until your taste buds are satisfied.\r\nPollen - Boost your profile to the top of other people\u2019s baskets.\r\nDaily Crushnotes - Increase your chances of matching & get exclusive juicy questions to help you make the tastiest first impression.\r\n\r\nTASTE THE EXCELLENCE WITH FRUITZ GOLDEN:\r\nWith Golden you\u2019ll get all the benefits of Premium, plus more sweet treats including:\r\n\r\nFilter by fruit - Only see profiles with fruits to your taste.\r\nSee who\u2019s picked you - Never miss a smoothie again, by seeing who\u2019s picked you already.\r\nIncognito Mode - Make yourself invisible to users you haven't liked yet.\r\n\r\nEVERYONE IS WELCOME:\r\nFruitz is open to everyone and aims to be a safe space for all including those from the gay, trans, and the entire LGBTQ+ community.\r\n\r\n----------------------------------- \r\nFruitz is free to download and use. However, we also offer optional subscription packages including: a 6 or 12-month Fruitz Premium package, and a 3-month or unlimited Fruitz Golden package. Prices may vary per country and are subject to change without notice. Prices are clearly displayed in the app.\r\n\r\nIf you choose to purchase Fruitz Premium or Golden, payment will be charged to your Play Store account after the order has been confirmed. Your subscription will auto-renew and you will be charged within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time by going to your settings in the Play Store after purchase. No cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during the active subscription period.\r\n\r\n----------------------------------- \r\n\r\nWe consider the security and privacy of our members very importantly. It is possible for you to prevent your Facebook contacts from seeing your profile. Every profile that would be reported by one of our members will be banned definitively and irrevocably from Fruitz. \r\n\r\n----------------------------------- \r\nPrivacy: https://fruitz.io/privacy \r\nTerms of Use: https://fruitz.io/terms \r\nContact: contact@fruitz.io",
    "descriptionHTML": "FIND DATES TO YOUR TASTE:<br>Fruitz is a dating app dedicated to helping you meet new people, who are looking for the same kind of relationship as you. With Fruitz you can cut straight to the chase with the security of knowing that you&#39;ll only match and meet with people who are on the same page. Whether you&#39;re looking for something serious, a date or two, or even just one night between the sheets - Fruitz has the fruits to help you directly express what you&#39;re looking for.<br><br>CHOOSE YOUR FRUIT: <br>How many times have you swiped right on dating apps, only to realise that the person on the other end of the chat is on a completely different page to you? Yep, thought as much! That&#39;s why with Fruitz you state what you&#39;re looking for from the start, by choosing a fruit that represents the type of relationship you want: <br><br>\ud83c\udf52 Cherry-pick the one for you <br>\ud83c\udf47 Have Grape dates, no headaches<br>\ud83c\udf49 Find fruits with benefits <br>\ud83c\udf51 Or for one night between the sheets<br><br>SAY GOODBYE TO BORING CHATS:<br>Dating doesn\u2019t have to be boring. On Fruitz you can start the chat on an interesting note, by choosing from hundreds of juicy opening questions. Some questions are wholesome and some will get you to reveal all your secrets...but that&#39;s usually how a great relationship starts, right? So, once you make a smoothie (a.k.a a match), you\u2019ll definitely get to know them well before you meet them IRL.<br><br>TASTE THE BEST WITH FRUITZ PREMIUM:<br>With Premium you can access exciting features including: <br><br>Unlimited likes - Swipe right until your taste buds are satisfied.<br>Pollen - Boost your profile to the top of other people\u2019s baskets.<br>Daily Crushnotes - Increase your chances of matching &amp; get exclusive juicy questions to help you make the tastiest first impression.<br><br>TASTE THE EXCELLENCE WITH FRUITZ GOLDEN:<br>With Golden you\u2019ll get all the benefits of Premium, plus more sweet treats including:<br><br>Filter by fruit - Only see profiles with fruits to your taste.<br>See who\u2019s picked you - Never miss a smoothie again, by seeing who\u2019s picked you already.<br>Incognito Mode - Make yourself invisible to users you haven&#39;t liked yet.<br><br>EVERYONE IS WELCOME:<br>Fruitz is open to everyone and aims to be a safe space for all including those from the gay, trans, and the entire LGBTQ+ community.<br><br>----------------------------------- <br>Fruitz is free to download and use. However, we also offer optional subscription packages including: a 6 or 12-month Fruitz Premium package, and a 3-month or unlimited Fruitz Golden package. Prices may vary per country and are subject to change without notice. Prices are clearly displayed in the app.<br><br>If you choose to purchase Fruitz Premium or Golden, payment will be charged to your Play Store account after the order has been confirmed. Your subscription will auto-renew and you will be charged within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time by going to your settings in the Play Store after purchase. No cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during the active subscription period.<br><br>----------------------------------- <br><br>We consider the security and privacy of our members very importantly. It is possible for you to prevent your Facebook contacts from seeing your profile. Every profile that would be reported by one of our members will be banned definitively and irrevocably from Fruitz. <br><br>----------------------------------- <br>Privacy: https://fruitz.io/privacy <br>Terms of Use: https://fruitz.io/terms <br>Contact: contact@fruitz.io",
